{{Velious Era}}'''Kael Drakkel''' (Sometimes Kael Drakk'''a'''l) is the home city of the giants of Velious - the Kromzek and the Kromrif. The city was founded by giant refugees fleeing the wrath of the other gods after Rallos Zek's invasion of the Plane of Earth. The city is home to the civilized Kromzek and their nomadic allies the Kromrif. The giants are ruled by the pugnacious Kromzek [[King Tormax]]. The city is hostile to all until they have proven themselves loyal to the giants' cause. For the allies of the giants shops, quests, and banking is available. For their enemies, you must pass the treacherous city if you wish to travel between Eastern Wastes and Wakening Land.

The religious zeal of the giants can lead to the [[Avatar of War]] spawning in the arena.

